WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:02.460
Matthew, Matthew 1.

00:03.500 --> 00:08.400
The book of the genealogy of Jesus Christ, the son of David, the son of Abraham.

00:09.280 --> 00:14.860
Abraham was the father of Isaac, and Isaac the father of Jacob, and Jacob the father

00:14.860 --> 00:21.600
of Judah and his brothers, and Judah the father of Pires and Zerah by Tamar, and Pires the

00:21.600 --> 00:27.500
father of Hezron, and Hezron the father of Ram, and Ram the father of Amminadab, and

00:27.500 --> 00:32.940
Amminadab the father of Nashan, and Nashan the father of Salmon, and Salmon the father

00:32.940 --> 00:40.580
of Boaz by Rahab, and Boaz the father of Obed by Ruth, and Obed the father of Jesse, and

00:40.580 --> 00:42.620
Jesse the father of David the king.

00:43.820 --> 00:49.700
And David was the father of Solomon by the wife of Uriah, and Solomon the father of Rehoboam,

00:50.140 --> 00:56.560
and Rehoboam the father of Abijah, and Abijah the father of Asaph, and Asaph the father

00:56.560 --> 00:57.480
of Jehoshaphat.

00:57.940 --> 01:04.200
And Jehoshaphat the father of Joram, and Joram the father of Uzziah, and Uzziah the father

01:04.200 --> 01:11.500
of Jotham, and Jotham the father of Ahaz, and Ahaz the father of Hezekiah, and Hezekiah

01:11.500 --> 01:19.020
the father of Manasseh, and Manasseh the father of Amos, and Amos the father of Josiah, and

01:19.020 --> 01:24.100
Josiah the father of Jeconiah and his brothers at the time of the deportation to Babylon.

01:24.760 --> 01:27.140
And after the deportation to Babylon.

01:27.500 --> 01:32.340
Jeconiah was the father of Shealtiel, and Shealtiel the father of Zerubbabel,

01:32.460 --> 01:37.100
and Zerubbabel the father of Abiyud, and Abiyud the father of Eliakim,

01:37.640 --> 01:41.980
and Eliakim the father of Azor, and Azor the father of Zadok,

01:42.360 --> 01:46.760
and Zadok the father of Akim, and Akim the father of Eliud,

01:47.140 --> 01:51.740
and Eliud the father of Eleazar, and Eleazar the father of Mathan,

01:52.280 --> 01:57.480
and Mathan the father of Jacob, and Jacob the father of Joseph the husband of Mary.

01:57.500 --> 02:06.180
of whom Jesus was born, who is called Christ. So all the generations from Abraham to David

02:06.180 --> 02:12.540
were fourteen generations, and from David to the deportation to Babylon, fourteen generations,

02:13.140 --> 02:18.000
and from the deportation to Babylon to the Christ, fourteen generations.

02:19.960 --> 02:26.020
Now the birth of Jesus Christ took place in this way. When his mother Mary had been betrothed to

02:26.020 --> 02:30.620
Joseph, before they came together she was found to be with child from the Holy Spirit,

02:31.220 --> 02:36.920
and her husband Joseph, being a just man and unwilling to put her to shame, resolved to

02:36.920 --> 02:43.240
divorce her quietly. But as he considered these things, behold, an angel of the Lord appeared to

02:43.240 --> 02:50.980
him in a dream, saying, Joseph, son of David, do not fear to take Mary as your wife, for that which

02:50.980 --> 02:55.400
is conceived in her is from the Holy Spirit. She will bear a son,

02:55.400 --> 03:01.020
and you shall call his name Jesus, for he will save his people from their sins.

03:01.920 --> 03:05.400
All this took place to fulfill what the Lord had spoken by the prophet.

03:06.300 --> 03:11.780
Behold, the virgin shall conceive and bear a son, and they shall call his name Emmanuel.

03:12.760 --> 03:19.520
Which means, God with us. When Joseph woke from sleep, he did as the angel of the Lord

03:19.520 --> 03:24.260
commanded him. He took his wife, but knew her not until she had given birth to a son.

03:25.400 --> 03:27.060
He called his name Jesus.

03:44.880 --> 03:45.320
So

03:45.320 --> 03:55.380
he called his wife, and she called his name Emmanuel, and he called his name Jesus.

